	(text "TEST REGISTER (decision 0001, option c; interface decision 0003)\nK1..K26 sense relays (lanes sheet), K27 STROBE relay, K28 JUDGE relay, K29 CLEAR relay (contact r, NC),\nK30 pass relay P, K31..K33 stop relay S (three relays, coils in parallel), K34 RELEASE relay.  All G6S-2 DPDT signal relays.\nJ1 = 26-wire test register cable (from the menu panel), J2 = bank control, J3 = display (lamp panel),\nJ4 = 24 V in, J5 = test voltage lead, J6 = front panel (START, RELEASE).  See README.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
